  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative efforts to balance sustainability with performance and safety. I propose a synthesis where we maintain the current logging delay in EFF-07 to ensure comprehensive audit trails while implementing energy-efficient algorithms and caching strategies to optimize performance (SAF-05). Additionally, I support exploring efficient methods for currency conversion (SAF-06) that align with our sustainability goals. This approach allows us to uphold our sustainability requirements without compromising the integrity and performance of the system.",
